This repository includes code adapted from third-party projects:

- contracts/migration-launch/src/LaunchMath.sol ports TickMath.getSqrtPriceAtTick
  (including its published constants) and the BalanceDelta unpacking from
  Uniswap v4-core (https://github.com/Uniswap/v4-core): src/libraries/TickMath.sol
  and src/types/BalanceDelta.sol, distributed under the MIT License. The original
  implementations remain the work of their authors.

- anvil-lab/ adapts the FullMath mulDiv algorithm and the TickMath factors and
  rounding from the same Uniswap v4-core libraries (MIT). See anvil-lab/NOTICE.md
  and anvil-lab/SOURCES.md.

Dependencies installed from npm, not vendored: @openzeppelin/contracts and
@openzeppelin/contracts-upgradeable 4.9.6 (MIT License).
